    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d383">

                <pb facs="0341" n="329" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg329"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.00/1857: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-04-08T10:00:00+03:25">April 8, 1942—10
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 10:36 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>99. Reference my No. 98, April 7. Prime Minister called me early this morning to
                    tell me he is not satisfied with Majlis’ decision refusing to expel Japanese and
                    that he is calling another secret session tomorrow in a final endeavor to obtain
                    such action. Meanwhile British Minister has telegraphed London reporting this
                    decision and requesting instructions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
